TITLE 150C pure water equilibrated with fixed-pressure gas mixture
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  0.4  10
    CO2(g)  0.4  10
    NH3(g)  0.2  5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -molalities NH3 NH4+ NO3- NO2-
    -totals N
END
